.TH portensor-probes-list 1  "list "
.SH NAME
portensor\-probes\-list \- List probe packs and their probes
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlist\fR [\fB\-\-plugins\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List probe packs and their probes
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-plugins\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Include probes from an additional pack file or directory
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit machine\-readable JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
